ca Latina a…</span></p></div><div data-generic-embed-host=\"true\" class=\"efatai0\"><p class=\"efatai1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">lu.ma/cn46f3gb</span></p></div></div><div data-generic-embed-image-wrapper=\"true\" data-generic-embed-image-right=\"true\" class=\"w-full mb-[20px] sm:mb-0 sm:ml-[20px] sm:w-[var(--generic-embed-image-width)] sm:basis-[var(--generic-embed-image-width)] flex\" style=\"align-self:center\"><img src=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,quality=80,format=auto,onerror=redirect/uploads/asset/file/f1d475b5-3d6a-4d14-b3ff-1b245b478d5e/Spotlight_TuCambioApp.png?t=1752092877\" class=\"w-full h-auto object-cover\" alt=\"\"></div></div></div></a></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"></p></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Abrimos el mes conversando con </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Luis Saavedra</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">, Co-Founder de </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>TuCambio</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">, una fintech que moderniza el envío de remesas en América Latina usando blockchain, criptomonedas e inteligencia artificial. Desde Chile, Perú y EE.UU. hacia países como Venezuela, Colombia y Argentina, TuCambio está agilizando transferencias en menos de 60 minutos.</span></p></div><div class=\"_7pt7ks0\"><div class=\"_7pt7ks1\"></div></div><div id=\"spotlight-tellus-a-0-x\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h2 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx3\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">🎙️ Spotlight Tellus × A0X</span></h2></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"dl6s8g0 hxnnnr0\">📅</span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong> Martes 22 de julio – 14:00 hrs (GMT-4)</strong></span><br><span class=\"dl6s8g0 hxnnnr0\">🔗</span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong> Inscríbete aquí:</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> </span></p></div><div data-generic-embed-container=\"true\" class=\"_8dv9ja0\"><a href=\"https://lu.ma/9uyeuy0p\" target=\"_blank\"><div class=\"_8dv9ja2\" style=\"--generic-embed-image-width:40%\"><div data-generic-embed-layout=\"true\" class=\"border-collapse w-full flex sm:flex-row flex-col-reverse\"><div class=\"_8dv9ja1\"><div data-generic-embed-title=\"true\" class=\"rq7pc90\"><p class=\"rq7pc91\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">🎙️ Spotlight Tellus × A0X: Agentes Autónomos desde Chile para el Mundo · Luma</span></p></div><div data-generic-embed-description=\"true\" class=\"_1uh4x2v0\"><p class=\"_1uh4x2v2\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">En este nuevo Spotlight de Tellus Cooperative nos acompaña Daniel Beltrán, Fundador de A0X, el equipo que ganó la primera hackathon completamente gestionada…</span></p></div><div data-generic-embed-host=\"true\" class=\"efatai0\"><p class=\"efatai1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">lu.ma/9uyeuy0p</span></p></div></div><div data-generic-embed-image-wrapper=\"true\" data-generic-embed-image-right=\"true\" class=\"w-full mb-[20px] sm:mb-0 sm:ml-[20px] sm:w-[var(--generic-embed-image-width)] sm:basis-[var(--generic-embed-image-width)] flex\" style=\"align-self:center\"><img src=\"https://social-images.lu.ma/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=cover,dpr=1,anim=false,background=white,quality=75,width=800,height=419/api/event-one?calendar_avatar=https%3A%2F%2Fimages.lumacdn.com%2Fcalendars%2Fl9%2F3276118b-2883-4fbf-a944-d01ec2ec296e.png&amp;calendar_name=Tellus%20Cooperative&amp;color0=%2323373f&amp;color1=%23afabbd&amp;color2=%23fbfbfc&amp;color3=%23d43a4a&amp;host_avatar=https%3A%2F%2Fimages.lumacdn.com%2Favatars%2Fqo%2Fe3e60b69-1699-4e21-9a85-d937e49ce1b9&amp;host_name=Pau%20Koh&amp;img=https%3A%2F%2Fimages.lumacdn.com%2Fevent-covers%2Fk1%2Ff0369814-7994-4398-84b3-4f29387ae98d.png&amp;name=%F0%9F%8E%99%EF%B8%8F%20Spotlight%20Tellus%20%C3%97%20A0X%3A%20Agentes%20Aut%C3%B3nomos%20desde%20Chile%20para%20el%20Mundo\" class=\"w-full h-auto object-cover\" alt=\"\"></div></div></div></a></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">En este encuentro conoceremos a </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Daniel Beltrán</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">, fundador de </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>A0X</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">, el equipo chileno que ganó la primera hackathon del mundo completamente gestionada por inteligencia artificial. Conversaremos sobre agentes autónomos, blockchain e IA, y cómo A0X planea abrir su tecnología a otros desarrolladores.</span></p></div><div class=\"_7pt7ks0\"><div class=\"_7pt7ks1\"></div></div><div id=\"stellar-quest-nivel-1\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h2 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx3\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"dl6s8g0 hxnnnr0\">🎯</span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> Stellar Quest Nivel 1</span></h2></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"dl6s8g0 hxnnnr0\">📅</span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong> Jueves 24 de julio – 14:00 hrs (GMT-4)</strong></span><br><span class=\"dl6s8g0 hxnnnr0\">🔗</span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong> Inscríbete aquí:</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> </span></p></div><div data-generic-embed-container=\"true\" class=\"_8dv9ja0\"><a href=\"https://lu.ma/lsyhapz9\" target=\"_blank\"><div class=\"_8dv9ja2\" style=\"--generic-embed-image-width:40%\"><div data-generic-embed-layout=\"true\" class=\"border-collapse w-full flex sm:flex-row flex-col-reverse\"><div class=\"_8dv9ja1\"><div data-generic-embed-title=\"true\" class=\"rq7pc90\"><p class=\"rq7pc91\"><span class=\"dl6s8g0 hxnnnr0\">🎯</span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Stellar Quest Nivel 1 — Vincula tu billetera y empieza tu aventura · Zoom · Luma</span></p></div><div data-generic-embed-description=\"true\" class=\"_1uh4x2v0\"><p class=\"_1uh4x2v2\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">¿Quieres aprender cómo funciona Stellar y completar tus primeras misiones en la blockchain?\nEn este evento vamos a ayudarte a conectar tu billetera Albedo con…</span></p></div><div data-generic-embed-host=\"true\" class=\"efatai0\"><p class=\"efatai1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">lu.ma/lsyhapz9</span></p></div></div><div data-generic-embed-image-wrapper=\"true\" data-generic-embed-image-right=\"true\" class=\"w-full mb-[20px] sm:mb-0 sm:ml-[20px] sm:w-[var(--generic-embed-image-width)] sm:basis-[var(--generic-embed-image-width)] flex\" style=\"align-self:center\"><img class=\"w-full h-auto object-cover\" alt=\"\"></div></div></div></a></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">¿Te interesa aprender sobre blockchain desde cero?</span><br><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">En este taller te enseñamos a usar </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Stellar</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> paso a paso:</span><br><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">• Crear tu cuenta</span><br><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">• Hacer tu primer pago</span><br><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">• Establecer una trustline</span></p></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Contaremos con el acompañamiento del equipo de </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>DOB Protocol</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">, quienes ya están construyendo sobre Stellar.</span><br><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Premios:</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> Polera oficial Stellar Quest + Mochila Stellar para quienes completen el nivel en vivo </span><span class=\"dl6s8g0 hxnnnr0\">🎒</span></p></div><div class=\"_7pt7ks0\"><div class=\"_7pt7ks1\"></div></div><div id=\"spotlight-tellus-skipo\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h2 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx3\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">🎙️ Spotlight Tellus × Skipo</span></h2></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"dl6s8g0 hxnnnr0\">📅</span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong> Viernes 25 de julio – 14:00 hrs (GMT-4)</strong></span><br><span class=\"dl6s8g0 hxnnnr0\">🔗</span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong> Inscríbete aquí:</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> </span></p></div><div data-generic-embed-container=\"true\" class=\"_8dv9ja0\"><a href=\"https://lu.ma/frczhe6e\" target=\"_blank\"><div class=\"_8dv9ja2\" style=\"--generic-embed-image-width:40%\"><div data-generic-embed-layout=\"true\" class=\"border-collapse w-full flex sm:flex-row flex-col-reverse\"><div class=\"_8dv9ja1\"><div data-generic-embed-title=\"true\" class=\"rq7pc90\"><p class=\"rq7pc91\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">🎙️ Spotlight Tellus × Skipo: Cripto sin Complicaciones desde Chile para Latinoamérica · Luma</span></p></div><div data-generic-embed-description=\"true\" class=\"_1uh4x2v0\"><p class=\"_1uh4x2v2\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">¿Quieres conocer cómo usar criptomonedas de forma simple, segura y práctica en tu día a día?\nEn este evento conversaremos con Nicolás Pizarro, del equipo de…</span></p></div><div data-generic-embed-host=\"true\" class=\"efatai0\"><p class=\"efatai1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">lu.ma/frczhe6e</span></p></div></div><div data-generic-embed-image-wrapper=\"true\" data-generic-embed-image-right=\"true\" class=\"w-full mb-[20px] sm:mb-0 sm:ml-[20px] sm:w-[var(--generic-embed-image-width)] sm:basis-[var(--generic-embed-image-width)] flex\" style=\"align-self:center\"><img src=\"https://social-images.lu.ma/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=cover,dpr=1,anim=false,background=white,quality=75,width=800,height=419/api/event-one?calendar_avatar=https%3A%2F%2Fimages.lumacdn.com%2Fcalendars%2Fl9%2F3276118b-2883-4fbf-a944-d01ec2ec296e.png&amp;calendar_name=Tellus%20Cooperative&amp;color0=%2323363d&amp;color1=%23e9e5e2&amp;color2=%23d83646&amp;color3=%232d75a5&amp;host_avatar=https%3A%2F%2Fimages.lumacdn.com%2Favatars%2Fqo%2Fe3e60b69-1699-4e21-9a85-d937e49ce1b9&amp;host_name=Pau%20Koh&amp;img=https%3A%2F%2Fimages.lumacdn.com%2Fevent-covers%2F4m%2F5d5591b7-4a56-4550-861e-fce7d907c2d9.png&amp;name=%F0%9F%8E%99%EF%B8%8F%20Spotlight%20Tellus%20%C3%97%20Skipo%3A%20Cripto%20sin%20Complicaciones%20desde%20Chile%20para%20Latinoam%C3%A9rica\" class=\"w-full h-auto object-cover\" alt=\"\"></div></div></div></a></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Cerramos el mes con </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Nicolás Pizarro</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">, parte del equipo de </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Skipo</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">, la billetera digital chilena que está simplificando el acceso a criptomonedas en la región. Conversaremos sobre pagos en comercios reales, cuentas remuneradas y transferencias sin fricción, todo desde una sola app.</span></p></div><div class=\"_7pt7ks0\"><div class=\"_7pt7ks1\"></div></div><div id=\"sorteos-en-todos-los-eventos\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h2 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx3\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"dl6s8g0 hxnnnr0\">🎁</span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> Sorteos en todos los eventos</span></h2></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Los eventos incluyen </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>sorteos en vivo</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> de poleras oficiales del Programa de Embajadores Stellar Chile. Y si completas Stellar Quest en vivo, puedes ganar también una </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>mochila oficial Stellar</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">.</span><br><span class=\"dl6s8g0 hxnnnr0\">📌</span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> Solo quienes se inscriban previamente podrán participar en los sorteos.</span></p></div><div class=\"_7pt7ks0\"><div class=\"_7pt7ks1\"></div></div><div id=\"te-interesa-aprender-compartir-y-co\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h2 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx3\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"dl6s8g0 hxnnnr0\">🚀</span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> ¿Te interesa aprender, compartir y conectar?</span></h2></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Estos eventos son una invitación abierta a construir juntos un ecosistema más accesible, educativo y colaborativo en torno a la Web3 en Latinoamérica.</span></p></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Organiza:</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> Tellus Cooperative</span><br><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Colaboran:</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> Stellar Chile, DOB Protocol, TuCambio, A0X, Skipo</span></p></div><div data-generic-embed-container=\"true\" class=\"_8dv9ja0\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/2SHteza5dJ\" target=\"_blank\"><div class=\"_8dv9ja2\" style=\"--generic-embed-image-width:40%\"><div data-generic-embed-layout=\"true\" class=\"border-collapse w-full flex sm:flex-row flex-col-reverse\"><div class=\"_8dv9ja1\"><div data-generic-embed-title=\"true\" class=\"rq7pc90\"><p class=\"rq7pc91\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">¡Únete al servidor de Discord Tellus Cooperative!</span></p></div><div data-generic-embed-description=\"true\" class=\"_1uh4x2v0\"><p class=\"_1uh4x2v2\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Echa un vistazo a la comunidad Tellus Cooperative en Discord. Pasa el rato con 106 miembros y disfruta de chat de voz y texto gratis.</span></p></div><div data-generic-embed-host=\"true\" class=\"efatai0\"><p class=\"efatai1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">discord.gg/2SHteza5dJ</span></p></div></div><div data-generic-embed-image-wrapper=\"true\" data-generic-embed-image-right=\"true\" class=\"w-full mb-[20px] sm:mb-0 sm:ml-[20px] sm:w-[var(--generic-embed-image-width)] sm:basis-[var(--generic-embed-image-width)] flex\" style=\"align-self:center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/splashes/871845192058146906/969229c90c917d6b7cc7d7ba70379861.jpg?size=512\" class=\"w-full h-auto object-cover\" alt=\"\"></div></div></div></a></div><div data-generic-embed-container=\"true\" class=\"_8dv9ja0\"><a href=\"https://chat.whatsapp.com/GURXILGTaOMLCVfKgUHnNc\" target=\"_blank\"><div c